# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vendored third-party tools — NOT part of this repo.
# scripts/setup.sh clones them at pinned commits and applies patches/.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/DynamicMPNN/
/ProteinMPNN/
/LigandMPNN/
/boltz/
/ProtFlow/

# Model weights and large tool installs (fetched by setup.sh)
/checkpoints/
/tools_af2/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Run artifacts. Full outputs (~2 GB/run) stay on the cluster; each run
# directory carries run_provenance.json recording the config that made it.
# results/ and figures/ are deliberately NOT ignored: they hold the small
# curated subsets that back the report.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/outputs/
/logs/
*.log
scratch/
slurm-*.out

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Inputs: the specific target + decoy PDBs the configs reference ARE tracked.
# Raw structures, MSA caches and scratch are not.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/inputs/*_raw.pdb
/inputs/holo_combined.pdb
/inputs/msa_cache/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python
#
# NOTE: do NOT add a bare `env/` rule here. This project keeps its conda/pip
# specification in env/, and a bare `env/` silently swallows it — `git add env/`
# then succeeds while staging nothing. Ignore virtualenvs by their real names.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editor / OS / secrets
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
*.orig
*.rej
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
